OL,3,GNEWSACable thieves strike again near M1
OL,4,Amotorway                               
OL,6,FThieves have once again stolen cables  
OL,7,Ffrom near the M1, causing problems with
OL,8,Foverhead information signs.            
OL,10,FThe latest incident happened in        
OL,11,FSteppingley near Flitwick,             
OL,12,FBedfordshire, between 01:00 and 04:00  
OL,13,FGMT on Wednesday.                      
OL,15,FIt follows incidents in Wilstead on 12 
OL,16,FNovember, and two separate thefts in   
OL,17,FLuton Road, near Toddington, on 5 and  
OL,18,F11 November.                           
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
